  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "线程池与回调",
      "items": [
        "AsyncHttpClient 默认用 Executors.newCachedThreadPool，sendRequest 把 AsyncHttpRequest 直接 submit 进去",
        "ResponseHandler 用创建时线程的 Looper 建 ResponderHandler，sendSuccessMessage 只是发 Message，真正回调发生在 Looper 线程"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "重试与取消",
      "items": [
        "RetryHandler 白名单含 NoHttpResponseException / UnknownHostException / SocketException，黑名单是 InterruptedIOException 与 SSLException",
        "取消只置 AtomicBoolean 并 abort 底层请求；AsyncHttpRequest.run 在多个检查点提前 return，已入队的回调不再发送"
      ]
    }
  ]
